{"2890660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skelemental: Monk's Fury", "steam_appid": 2890660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/1aa94145ac29d6e3bf088266ce3a5892.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/1aa94145ac29d6e3bf088266ce3a5892.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/1aa94145ac29d6e3bf088266ce3a5892.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortis is a land of imbalance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Skeleton Monk, a powerful Elemental Manipulator and skilled martial artist. Scour a ravaged and corrupted land inspired by Japanese mythology, you carve a path through a world consumed by imbalance, seeking revenge and the fate of your captured lover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/c33186f4a0c28b29f8e4a1274c8482ae.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/c33186f4a0c28b29f8e4a1274c8482ae.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/c33186f4a0c28b29f8e4a1274c8482ae.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Impactful Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, responsive melee combat focused on timing, spacing, and combo mastery. Build Spirit through aggression and skillful play to unleash powerful abilities  in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/afa3e819c86ca659dc37b6a3044bf730.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/afa3e819c86ca659dc37b6a3044bf730.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/afa3e819c86ca659dc37b6a3044bf730.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Elemental Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse your strikes with elemental forces, creating dynamic combat interactions and unlocking different paths and interactions throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/68af030ee5e7c0bb7b4e5d91c78ece88.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/68af030ee5e7c0bb7b4e5d91c78ece88.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/68af030ee5e7c0bb7b4e5d91c78ece88.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bone-Based Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace and upgrade parts of your skeleton. Swap skulls, arms, and other bones to gain unique stat bonuses, alter your build, and visually transform your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World in Ruin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a haunting, interconnected land shaped by imbalance. Discover shortcuts, secrets, and hidden challenges as you explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/dfddae2b71e335e83895b2b7cb01f8b4.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/dfddae2b71e335e83895b2b7cb01f8b4.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/dfddae2b71e335e83895b2b7cb01f8b4.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/1aa94145ac29d6e3bf088266ce3a5892.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/1aa94145ac29d6e3bf088266ce3a5892.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/1aa94145ac29d6e3bf088266ce3a5892.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortis is a land of imbalance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Skeleton Monk, a powerful Elemental Manipulator and skilled martial artist. Scour a ravaged and corrupted land inspired by Japanese mythology, you carve a path through a world consumed by imbalance, seeking revenge and the fate of your captured lover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/c33186f4a0c28b29f8e4a1274c8482ae.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/c33186f4a0c28b29f8e4a1274c8482ae.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/c33186f4a0c28b29f8e4a1274c8482ae.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Impactful Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, responsive melee combat focused on timing, spacing, and combo mastery. Build Spirit through aggression and skillful play to unleash powerful abilities  in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/afa3e819c86ca659dc37b6a3044bf730.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/afa3e819c86ca659dc37b6a3044bf730.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/afa3e819c86ca659dc37b6a3044bf730.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Elemental Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse your strikes with elemental forces, creating dynamic combat interactions and unlocking different paths and interactions throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/68af030ee5e7c0bb7b4e5d91c78ece88.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/68af030ee5e7c0bb7b4e5d91c78ece88.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/68af030ee5e7c0bb7b4e5d91c78ece88.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bone-Based Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace and upgrade parts of your skeleton. Swap skulls, arms, and other bones to gain unique stat bonuses, alter your build, and visually transform your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World in Ruin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a haunting, interconnected land shaped by imbalance. Discover shortcuts, secrets, and hidden challenges as you explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/dfddae2b71e335e83895b2b7cb01f8b4.poster.avif?t=1773956038\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/dfddae2b71e335e83895b2b7cb01f8b4.webm?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/dfddae2b71e335e83895b2b7cb01f8b4.mp4?t=1773956038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Reborn as the Skeleton Monk after a deadly betrayal, you scour a ravaged and corrupted land to find your captured lover and exact revenge on the one who killed you. Master impactful martial arts combos imbued with elemental power to avenge your own death and bring balance to the land of Mortis.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps